    "CoiStatement": "Potential Conflicts of Interest: Dr. Gravallese has received research grant funding from Abbvie, Inc., and Eli Lilly and Company. She has served as a consultant for: Abbvie, Inc.; Amgen; Eli Lilly and Company; Flexion; Sanofi; GlaxoSmithKline; Merck; Novo Nordisk and SeraCare. She holds stock in Johnson and Johnson and receives royalties from Elsevier (textbook editor, Rheumatology) and UptoDate.",
